9B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cTDYb7Ex1Q0Q7kNvwENlr8Z&_nc_oc=Adk640VzDxBJpn-HWBSCyTTHcDF_ouKCBNXMEpwu5SOmTFcso_Fcj-_VeE6-Tq6LN5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuxRUbGUVFaeO8P_r4hFG_E7B77UWNOtmBBNDZH-cVHgg&oe=69A976D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V4yWBr3a3XgQ7kNvwHl7HYh&_nc_oc=AdlQKaFYKwmKTqZf-fOSF9in1I0qs7dD1atQJs8R2wLtdF_pO6LW1HMcF-rAejYSS9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftY8B9q5bD1CU0DOVUsITUVKbBZ9Gz1xhAxfXfdGcPJ3Q&oe=69A97C15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ktHUd0X4EQQ7kNvwHkFAsk&_nc_oc=AdkjieDJIT_ZTeK-meWvMmfuygVISOZPLNP7BFZuKx-tC_1FW6g5v-mERS-yzv6nSKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftLzmpW0kVh5-Oc6a_IwdhTn-Rh6p8EJYIGs9HkcMrS8g&oe=69A98FC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q-pkx0t1zWMQ7kNvwHkjjp_&_nc_oc=AdlJ2F7BcHauAItwVZn6PCfdZHSfzZXtzNIzMGM4t_ouRYLMl1ZiqH-BnWztt0Z3xoM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftMHMI7O9_y6gL0M3RYe4WBPP1XfZTD0lwq5J5IfbJypw&oe=69A97644"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2WET06zTAy8Q7kNvwGgsCYv&_nc_oc=AdmVYf5DWI7-JOmy1OcYx6UnW9DT88NTOrCRuYLKrSGoy3d996Py7IW6VK7CmbZn1-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvWnbuK5Teob7drRfvZmMGoT7goxB1uF-mfwQ1gy3hxCA&oe=69A96EA2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 